 cashtop  1 Dashboard  2 Workers  3 Blocks  4 Feed  5 Network                                            ● 12:00:00 UTC 
                                                                                                                        
           ┌─ Help 1-31/56 (j/k scroll) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐           
           │Keys                                                                                            │           
           │1 2 3 4 5     Dashboard, Workers, Blocks, Feed, Network                                         │           
           │tab / h l     next / previous tab                                                               │           
           │j k / arrows  move selection, scroll (also scrolls this help)                                   │           
           │g G           first / last (Feed: G follows new events)                                         │           
           │enter         Dashboard: miner view of the picked round row; Workers: address view;             │           
           │              Blocks: sharelog jobs for the height                                              │           
           │o             Workers: show or hide workers that are off                                        │           
           │/             search: a height, an address or a worker name                                     │           
           │:             command: test-celebrate replays the newest block, q quits                         │           
           │esc           close search, help or a detail view                                               │           
           │esc enter spc dismiss the block-found banner                                                    │           
           │r             Feed: toggle share rain                                                           │           
           │ctrl+l        redraw the whole screen after the terminal got garbled                            │           
           │?             this help                                                                         │           
           │q  ctrl+c     quit                                                                              │           
           │                                                                                                │           
           │Pool box                                                                                        │           
           │workers       live, stale, idle and off workers, classified by the table below                  │           
           │reported      conn: clients; idle: >60s no share; resum: dropped, kept 600s                     │           
           │              daemon counts; not comparable to live/stale/off                                   │           
           │rejected      rejected / (accepted + rejected) share difficulty                                 │           
           │last pool bloctime since the pool last found a block                                            │           
           │top round     the address with the biggest share of the pool round since the last block         │           
           │                                                                                                │           
           │Effort                                                                                          │           
           │round effort  accepted share difficulty / network difficulty x 100                              │           
           │pool effort   the whole pool's work since the pool's previous block / network difficulty x 100  │           
           │finder effort the finder's own work since its previous block / network difficulty x 100;        │           
           │              each miner's round restarts at its own blocks, so it can far exceed pool effort;  │           
           │              - when unknown                                                                    │           
           └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘           
